@* A section RCL does NOT inherit the host's Views/_ViewImports.cshtml. Omitting a line
   here ships broken markup with a green build and no runtime error — see design §1/§2.
   Guarded by the rendered-HTML diff in step 12. *@
@using Humans.Finance.Contracts
@using Humans.Finance.Models
@using Humans.Base.Extensions
@using Humans.Base
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Localization
@* No FinanceResource: these are English-only finance-admin pages with zero Localizer call
   sites, so the section carves no .resx (design §15 step 3b). SharedLocalizer is bound for the
   first view here that needs a string; a Finance-owned set is created the day one exists. *@
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResource> SharedLocalizer
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
@addTagHelper *, Humans.Base
